<title>UK: Commerzbank unit sets 400 mln Dkr Dec 2003 bond.</title>
<headline>Commerzbank unit sets 400 mln Dkr Dec 2003 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett and Banque Bruxelles Luxembourg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COMMERZBANK OVERSEAS FINANCE NV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  COMMERZBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DKR   COUPON     6.00	MATURITY    11.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.828   PAY DATE  S-11.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     YIELD	5.67 PCT  S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 10-50     SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    =	   SELL CONC  =	   PRAECIPUUM  0.25</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
